{"headword":"רָעָה","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>vb. pasture, tend, graze (</strong>Assyrian <em>rêʾû</em> vb. <em>pasture</em>, n. <em>ruler</em>, TelAm. <em>ruh̬i</em> (as Canaanism) Wkl<sup>No. 181, 11</sup>; Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">رَدَى</span>, Ethiopic ርዕየ Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">רְעָא</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܪܥܳܐ</span>, all = BH<strong>)</strong>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. 3 ms. consec. <span dir=\"rtl\">וְרָעָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Micah 5:3\" href=\"/Micah.5.3\">Mi 5:3</a> +, 1 s. sf. consec. <span dir=\"rtl\">וּרְעִיתִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 34:13\" href=\"/Ezekiel.34.13\">Ez 34:13</a>, 3 pl. sf. consec. <span dir=\"rtl\">וְרָעוּם</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 23:4\" href=\"/Jeremiah.23.4\">Je 23:4</a>, etc.; Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִרְעֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 27:10\" href=\"/Isaiah.27.10\">Is 27:10</a> +, juss. <span dir=\"rtl\">יֵרַע</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 20:26\" href=\"/Job.20.26\">Jb 20:26</a>, sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִעֶנָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 80:14\" href=\"/Psalms.80.14\">ψ 80:14</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּרְעֵם</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:72\" href=\"/Psalms.78.72\">ψ 78:72</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּר׳</span> <strong>Hiph.</strong> van d. H.), etc.; Imv. ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">רְעֵה</span> <a data-ref=\"Micah 7:14\" href=\"/Micah.7.14\">Mi 7:14</a> +, sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">רְעֵם</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 28:9\" href=\"/Psalms.28.9\">ψ 28:9</a>; fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">רְעִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 1:8\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.1.8\">Ct 1:8</a>; mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">רְעוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 29:7\" href=\"/Genesis.29.7\">Gn 29:7</a>; Inf. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">לִרְעוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 37:12\" href=\"/Genesis.37.12\">37:12</a> +, etc.; Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">רֹעֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:36\" href=\"/Genesis.30.36\">30:36</a> +, sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">רֹעִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 23:1\" href=\"/Psalms.23.1\