ah.65.25\">65:25</a> <a data-ref=\"Jonah 3:7\" href=\"/Jonah.3.7\">Jon 3:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 1:14\" href=\"/Job.1.14\">Jb 1:14</a>."}],"num":"a."},{"senses":[{"definition":"fig. of idolater, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 44:20\" href=\"/Isaiah.44.20\">Is 44:20</a> <em>he feedeth on ashes</em> (acc.); cf. <a data-ref=\"Hosea 12:2\" href=\"/Hosea.12.2\">Ho 12:2</a> Ephr. <em>feedeth on wind</em> (acc.); <span dir=\"rtl\">פִּי כְסִילִים יִר׳ אִוֶּלֶת</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 15:14\" href=\"/Proverbs.15.14\">Pr 15:14</a> (so Vrss Qr; Kt <span dir=\"rtl\">פני</span> for <span dir=\"rtl\">פי</span>) <em>the mouth of fools feeds on folly</em> (Toy; Buhl √ II. <span dir=\"rtl\">רעה</span>, Gerber <sup>162</sup> sub III. <span dir=\"rtl\">רעה</span>); in Ct, c. ב loc., fig. of lover <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 2:16\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.2.16\">Ct 2:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 6:2\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.6.2\">6:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 6:3\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.6.3\">3</a>; of breasts (like gazelles) <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 4:5\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.4.5\">4:5</a>."}],"num":"b."},{"senses":[{"definition":"fig., of Isr. as flock <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 14:30\" href=\"/Isaiah.14.30\">Is 14:30</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">רבץ</span>), read <span dir=\"rtl\">(י—ַ)בְּכָרִי</span> <em>in my pasture</em>(<em>s</em>), for MT <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּכוֹרֵי</span>, Koppe Ew Di Du (otherwise Che<sup>Hpt.</sup>, cf. Marti); <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 3:13\" href=\"/Zephaniah.3.13\">Zp 3:13</a> (‖ id.); c. <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל־דְּרָכִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 49:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.49.9\">Is 49:9</a>; c. acc. of pasture-land <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 50:19\" href=\"/Jeremiah.50.19\">Je 50:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Micah 7:14\" href=\"/Micah.7.14\">Mi 7:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 34:14\" href=\"/Ezekiel.34.14\">Ez 34:14b</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶל</span> loc.), v <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 34:18\" href=\"/Ezekiel.34.18\">18</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 34:19\" href=\"/Ezekiel.34.19\">19</a>; hence <em>crop, strip</em>, i.e. devastate, of conqueror, c. acc. of land <a data-ref=\"Micah 5:5\" href=\"/Micah.5.5\">Mi 5:5</a>, cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶת־יָדוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 6:3\" href=\"/Jeremiah.6.3\">Je 6:3</a>; so <span dir=\"rtl\">יִרְעוּךְ קָדְקֹד</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 2:16\" href=\"/Jeremiah.2.16\">2:16</a>; acc. of Isr. under fig. of vine (subj. foes, as beasts) <a data-ref=\"Psalms 80:14\" href=\"/Psalms.80.14\">ψ 80:14</a>."}],"num":"c."},{"senses":[{"definition":"subj. wind, c. acc. pers. <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 22:22\" href=\"/Jeremiah.22.22\">Je 22:22</a>, i.e. drive them away; subj. fire, c. acc. rei, <span dir=\"rtl\">יֵרַע</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 20:26\" href=\"/Job.20.26\">Jb 20:26</a>, but read perhaps <span dir=\"rtl\">יֵרָע</span>, <strong>Niph.</strong> (Ol Di Hoffm Siegf Bu; otherwise Du).—<span dir=\"rtl\">רֹעֶה עֲקָרָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 24:21\" href=\"/Job.24.21\">24:21</a> is difficult; Bu <span dir=\"rtl\">הֵרַע</span> for <span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳</span>; more radical conj. in Du."}],"num":"d."}],"num":"2."}],"form":"Qal"},{"senses":[{"definition":"poss. <a data-ref=\"Job 20:26\" href=\"/Job.20.26\">Jb 20:26</a>, v. <strong>2 d</strong> supr."}],"form":"Niph."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:72\" href=\"/Psalms.78.72\">ψ 78:72</a> van d. H., v. <strong>1 c</strong> supr."}],"form":"Hiph."}]},"rid":"BDB09424","strong_numbers":["7451","7462","7465","7473"],"next_hw":"רֹעֶה","prev_hw":"רְעָדָה","ordinal":"I.","root":true,"occurrences":"167","quotes":[],"GK":["8273","8286","8287","8288","8289"],"TWOT":["2185","2186","2191c","2192"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Brigg